mponents/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#best-practices","content":"Remember valid steps start from &#x2A;*`minValue`**."},"708":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-34","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#best-practices","content":"Use &#x2A;*`isDisabled`*&#x2A; when the value cannot be changed; use &#x2A;*`isReadOnly`** when the value should be visible but not editable. Do not use them interchangeably."},"709":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-35","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#best-practices","content":"For currency or units, ensure &#x2A;*`formatOptions`** (and locale) match what users are allowed to type."},"710":{"id":"/docs/components/number-field-36","page_id":"/docs/components/number-field","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/number-field#props","content":"The `NumberField` component accepts the following props:"},"711":{"id":"/docs/components/modal","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"page","content":"Modal","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal"},"712":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-0","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal","content":"The Modal component presents a dialog window over the page that focuses the user's attention on a single task or piece of information."},"713":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-1","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#installation","content":"Installation"},"714":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-2","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#examples","content":"Examples"},"715":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-3","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/modal#default","content":"Default"},"716":{"id":"/