ault `0`–`100`)"],[799,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value"],[135,"`aria-valuenow` reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[801,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"],[137,"`aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[1582,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[105,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[1341,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[1551,"`colorIndex` pins each series to a palette color. Any series can use any index,\nindependently — here two pairs each share an index so an actual line and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."],[1077,"`Content`, `Header`, `Footer`, and `ButtonGroup` each accept all `Flex` layout props."],[834,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[491,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[494,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[490,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[492,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[493,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[495,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1118,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[259,"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"],[299,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[775,"`Enter/Space`"],[342,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[567,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[308,"`Escape`"],[733,"`Escape`"],[777,"`Escape`"],[1346,"`Escape`"],[399,"`FieldGroup` is purely presentational — it renders the styled `Group` and holds no React Aria context. The surrounding field wires value, disabled, and validation state into its controls."],[400,"`FieldGroup` rounds its outer corners from DOM order: the group's CSS rounds the start corners of its **first child** and the end corners of its **last child**, so controls are seamless inside and rounded only at the box edges. Author children in visual order and the rounding follows — no per-control positioning prop. A lone control (a TextField input, a Select trigger) is both first and last, so it rounds both edges. The rules are RTL-safe (they use logical `start`/`end` corners)."],[396,"`FieldLabel`, `FieldDescription`, and `FieldError` each render `null` when they have no content, so callers pass `label` / `description` / `errorMessage` straight through without guarding."],[368,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."],[1619,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[499,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[272,"`formatOptions` accepts any `Intl.DateTimeFormatOptions` (e.g. `{ date